<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results on the second day of the Gold Coast Classic women's tennis tournament at Hope Island on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 7-6 (7-5)  6-3</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Nertherlands) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Catalina Cristea (Romania) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Jana Kandarr (Germany) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-4 6-3.</p>
</text>
